      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can reproduce and has been an issue for a long time. It wont show locally, but everyone else can see what emote or gesture was suppose to go off from fist slot if user is on desktop. Had to switch to another slot as well to avoid the issue and not accidently play music on that slot.\n\nThe problem maybe that the fist slot isn't cleared when pressing F1, but is cleared when using another slot, like F3-F8 and back to F1.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
